From 60c4b3cfa57d013234c02cc7e965685547030c62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:19:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add player-control capability and world collision for
 server mods

New WIT interface player-control (get-motion, teleport, take-xp, play-sound),
world.get-collision, and the matching manifest capability, runtime host,
test harness and game wiring. Experimental, server mods only.
